  "schema": "mxh.playdh-supplemental-fill/1",
  "note": "Names only, no content. The pak is never committed: it is built locally on ROG from the original client Map.pak by pak_writer.py and deploy verifies it against pakSha256. Entry sha256 and pakSha256 are null until that extraction; pak_writer.py refuses to pack an entry whose sha256 is null. Deploy reads buildPath and does not parse the pak description.",
  "pak": "D:\\build-mxr\\supplement\\zz_supplement.pak (built locally on ROG outside any git worktree, never committed); deploy copies it into <PlayDH root>/zz_supplement.pak",
  "buildPath": "D:\\build-mxr\\supplement\\zz_supplement.pak",
  "pakSha256": null,
  "format": "96-byte original header (docs/formats/pak.md variant B)",
  "builder": "python3 modern/tools/pak_writer.py --manifest reference/manifests/playdh-supplemental-fill.json --input-dir <extracted> --out D:\\build-mxr\\supplement\\zz_supplement.pak --conflict-root <PlayDH root>",
  "deploy": "verify sha256(D:\\build-mxr\\supplement\\zz_supplement.pak) == pakSha256, then copy it into <PlayDH root>/zz_supplement.pak (PlayDH lives in a git worktree, which pak_writer.py refuses as --out)",
  "workflow": "Per-ticket commits (TYJ-148..151) change only this file: entry sha256 values and the expected pakSha256. The pak itself is never committed.",
  "acceptance": [
    "pak_writer.py on ROG builds D:\\build-mxr\\supplement\\zz_supplement.pak (outside any worktree) with sha256 == pakSha256, twice, identical; only then is it copied into <PlayDH root>",
    "pak_writer.py --conflict-root <PlayDH root> passes: no basename shared with the 7 PlayDH paks",
    "resource_reference_gate.py check on the PlayDH root: no collision, missing_playdh_in_mx for the ticket's maps drops to 0",
    "ROG gate (MSVC) CTest mxh_pak_writer_packfile_tests passes: PackFile sees only the 96-byte layout",
    "ROG actual client log [pak] mount order lists 8 paks with zz_supplement.pak last (this fill PR only; P1 stays at 7). The name was chosen so it should mount last (only 96-byte pak, sorts after the 7 PlayDH names), but that is an inference from FilesystemFileStorage; only this log is acceptance",
    "map smoke for 90/401/321 and the TYJ-151 maps loads with no FSOpenFile failure",
    "scripts/check-no-pak-changes.py passes: no *.pak path added or modified in the PR"
  ],
